class=\"i b6\"><div class=\"ay\"><div class=\"b3\"><div class=\"b7\"><h2 id=\"career\">Career</h2><p>2022-now<br/>SIA Architect &amp; Interior Designer<br/>Claire Duchamp Architecte SàRL, Vevey</p><p>2022<br/>SIA Member<br/>Swiss Society of Engineers and Architects</p><p>2022<br/>EPF-SEFRI Architect Equivalence</p><p>2020-2021<br/>Architect Projet Manager<br/>CP3, Lausanne</p><p>2016-2020<br/>Architect Projet Manager<br/>a|alberti, Monthey</p><p>2013-2015<br/>Assistant Architect<br/>Badoche Romatet Architectes, Paris</p><p>2014<br/>Authorization for project management in one&#x27;s own name<br/>National Higher School of Architecture Paris-Malaquais</p><p>2013<br/>Architect State Diploma<br/>National Higher School of Architecture Paris-Malaquais</p></div><div class=\"b8\"><h2 id=\"references\">References</h2><h3 id=\"housing\">Housing</h3><p>Villa, Grandvaux, VD<br/>2022-2023</p><p>Villa, Majorque, ES<br/>2021, on behalf of CP3</p><p>Tenement, Lausanne, VD<br/>15 apartments<br/>2020, on behalf of CP3</p><p>Cottage, Morgins, VD<br/>2020, on behalf of CP3</p><p>Villa, Bex, VS<br/>2020, on behalf of <small>a|</small>alberti</p><p>Semi-detached villas, Choëx, VS<br/>2020, on behalf of <small>a|</small>alberti</p><p>Cottage les Giettes, Monthey, VS<br/>2020, on behalf of <small>a|</small>alberti</p><h5 id=\"terciary-sector\">Terciary Sector</h5><p><em>Vaudoise Aréna</em>, Lausanne<br/>Restaurant cover<br/>2020, on behalf of CP3</p><p>Shops, Monthey<br/>3 commercial premises<br/>2020, on behalf of <small>a|</small>alberti</p><p><em>Le Relais d&#x27;Or</em>, Colombey<br/>Senior residence<br/>2020, on behalf of <small>a|</small>alberti</p><h5 id=\"public-sector\">Public Sector</h5><p><em>Les Goilles</em>, Monthey<br/>Neighborhood plan<br/>2020, on behalf of <small>a|</small>alberti</p><p><em>Reconfière</em>, Monthey<br/>Detailed development plan<br/>2020, on behalf of <small>a|</small>alberti</p><p>City Hall, Vouvry<br/>Architectural competition, 1<sup>st</sup> prize<br/>2020, on behalf of <small>a|</small>alberti</p></div></div></div></div></article><footer class=\"cg\"><div class=\"ch\"><div class=\"ci\"><div class=\"cm cs\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/claire_duchamp_architect/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cn cs\">Instagram</a></div><div class=\"cm ct\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/claire-duchamp-4904b6a5\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cn ct\">LinkedIn</a></div></div><div class=\"cl\"><div class=\"cj\"><div class=\"cm co\"><a class=\"cn co\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/legal-notice\">Legal notice</a></div><div class=\"cm cp\"><a class=\"cn cp\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy policy</a></div></div><div class=\"cw\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/b26oyumKkiTRXwmQA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cu\"><span class=\"cv\">Claire Duchamp Architecte</span><span class=\"cv\">Rue de la Clergère 2</span><span class=\"cv\">CH-1800 Vevey</span></a></div></div><div class=\"ck\"><div class=\"cm cq\">Photos: <a href=\"http://www.juliemasson.ch/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cn cq\">Julie Masson</a></div><div class=\"cm cr\">Website: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/adrien-febvay\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cn cr\">Adrien Febvay</a></div></div></div></footer><script>window.__staticRouterHydrationData = JSON.parse(\"{\\\"loaderData\\\":{\\\"0\\\":null,\\\"0-0\\\":null},\\\"actionData\\\":null,\\\"errors\\\":null}\");</script></div></body></html>","status":200}